WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.143
Two A I assistants share one phone.

2
00:00:03.143 --> 00:00:05.634
Watch one hand work to the other.

3
00:00:05.634 --> 00:00:11.675
By the end, ChatGPT has sent a task, Claude has finished it, on Android and iOS.

4
00:00:13.275 --> 00:00:15.707
Normally each assistant works alone.

5
00:00:15.707 --> 00:00:17.936
You copy and paste between chats.

6
00:00:17.936 --> 00:00:19.625
Here, they share a phone.

7
00:00:21.225 --> 00:00:26.068
Connect both assistants to the same phone, and install the Assistant Inbox.

8
00:00:26.068 --> 00:00:30.459
The phone knows who is calling from the name each one connects with.

9
00:00:30.459 --> 00:00:31.750
Nobody types a name.

10
00:00:33.350 --> 00:00:36.695
First, ChatGPT calls send message, to Claude.

11
00:00:36.695 --> 00:00:38.033
Look at the phone.

12
00:00:38.033 --> 00:00:39.594
Chat G P T to Claude.

13
00:00:39.594 --> 00:00:41.675
The sender filled itself in.

14
00:00:43.275 --> 00:00:47.450
Claude's next call of any phone tool starts with one line.

15
00:00:47.450 --> 00:00:49.537
Inbox, one unread for Claude.

16
00:00:49.537 --> 00:00:51.625
Nobody says check your inbox.

17
00:00:53.225 --> 00:00:56.483
Claude reads it with check inbox, and answers.

18
00:00:56.483 --> 00:00:56.767
Yes.

19
00:00:56.767 --> 00:00:58.396
Send it over as a task.

20
00:00:58.396 --> 00:01:00.733
Will the task come back finished?

21
00:01:00.733 --> 00:01:02.150
Watch the Tasks tab.

22
00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:05.868
Now ChatGPT hands off a task.

23
00:01:05.868 --> 00:01:07.694
Review the checkout plan.

24
00:01:07.694 --> 00:01:11.200
It appears on the Tasks tab, waiting for Claude.

25
00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:14.476
Claude lists its tasks.

26
00:01:14.476 --> 00:01:15.641
Starts the task.

27
00:01:15.641 --> 00:01:17.900
Then finishes it, with a reply.

28
00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:24.037
Back on ChatGPT's side, sent tasks shows it done, with the answer.

29
00:01:24.037 --> 00:01:25.137
Plan looks good.

30
00:01:25.137 --> 00:01:27.200
Add a back button on the cart.

31
00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:30.973
Only the right assistant can act.

32
00:01:30.973 --> 00:01:34.925
A task for someone else returns updated: false, and says why.

33
00:01:34.925 --> 00:01:37.625
Nobody is told it worked when it did not.

34
00:01:39.225 --> 00:01:42.765
The same exchange runs on Android and iOS.

35
00:01:42.765 --> 00:01:43.607
Same data.

36
00:01:43.607 --> 00:01:44.450
Same tabs.

37
00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:48.573
That is two assistants, one inbox.

38
00:01:48.573 --> 00:01:54.139
Run npx shipvo agents setup, connect both, and install the Assistant Inbox.

39
00:01:54.139 --> 00:01:57.405
The guide is at shipvo.dev/learn.

40
00:01:57.405 --> 00:02:00.225
Next, have an assistant test your app.
